  "scope": "Resolve note embeds recursively through VaultRoot and VaultSession under one stable snapshot, then show bounded read-only transclusion source previews and explicit failure states in the native egui link-inspection UI.",
  "behavior": [
    "VaultRoot::resolve_note_embeds_for_note extracts only embed references from a Markdown source note and returns a snapshot-bound report with nested VaultNoteEmbedNode values.",
    "Every nested result must match the report snapshot. Existing path confinement, Markdown-only target filtering, the 512 KiB per-source limit, and cycle/depth guards apply before rendering; expansion is capped at 32 nodes and reports omitted references.",
    "VaultSession exposes the report through the engine boundary. The egui worker resolves it off the UI thread, shows included text with a 16 KiB display cap, and labels unresolved/ambiguous targets, cycles, depth limits, and omitted nodes. Vault files remain read-only.",
    "The C03 link fixture contains a self-reference within a selected block. Its egui interaction verifies included source text, cycle and attachment failure messages, bounded tree behavior, and unchanged fixture bytes."
  ],
